{"id":"d89d26f801265a76","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-dualization.md","title":"DNF dual recognition and complete dualization","display":"df-dualization — DNF dual recognition and complete dualization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-dualization","aliases":["27-df-dualization"],"display":"df-dualization — DNF dual recognition and complete dualization","depends_on":["[[27-df-dual]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-piset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-dualization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-dualization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dualization — DNF dual recognition and complete dualization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dual}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Dual}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\coloneqq\\{(D,E)\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n^2:\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{CompleteDual}_n(D)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PI}(\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)))\\quad(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\coloneqq\\{(D,E)\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n^2:\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{CompleteDual}_n(D)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PI}(\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)))\\quad(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §4.3.1, Dual Recognition and DNF Dualization，印刷页 183，PDF 第 207 页（从 1 计数）。 保留 DUAL_n 作为任意输出表示的识别关系，并新增原书实际列举任务的唯一输出 CompleteDual_n；它要求全部素蕴涵项，不只是某个等价 DNF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dual}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\coloneqq\\{(D,E)\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n^2:\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{CompleteDual}_n(D)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PI}(\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)))\\quad(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n).","display":true}],"bytes":1315,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-dualization|df-dualization — DNF dual recognition and complete dualization]]"},{"id":"909d426f97993ae5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ and $\\mathrm{pair}$ are the explicit binary encodings of [[27-df-encoding]]; $\\mathrm{DUAL}_n$ and $\\mathbf{coNPC}$ are defined in [[27-df-dualization]] and [[27-df-conpcomplete]]."}],"outgoing":["b491e41297256b44","0b618255959ff4bc","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","5d10aed668d85817"]}